        "# Phantom Profile Generator\n",
        "\n",
        "Pre-computes three audio enhancement profiles (Tier 1/2/3) for the Phantom-Audio userscript.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Folder structure:**\n",
        "```\n",
        "/content/drive/MyDrive/L●○P/HYDRA/\n",
        "  Phantom_Profile/\n",
        "    Echo/           ← audio files (.mp3, .m4a, .ogg, .wav)\n",
        "    Encor/\n",
        "      filenames.txt  ← one filename per line from Echo/\n",
        "      Profile_Outputs/  ← generated profile files\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "**Outputs per audio file:**\n",
        "1. `<name>.pretty.json` — human-readable\n",
        "2. `<name>.compact.json` — minified JSON\n",
        "3. `<name>.pbf` — Phantom Binary Format (ultra-compressed, machine-only)"
      ]
